property_circular_definition	REFUSED xacro_structural_error	REFUSED undefined_property	upstream evaluates a property at its first read and refuses a property whose evaluation reads itself again through another as a circular definition, while here each property is evaluated where it is written, so the first one refuses for the name below it that is not yet defined
property_self_reference	REFUSED xacro_structural_error	<robot name="probe"><link name="l2"></link></robot>	upstream evaluates a redefined property at its first read in the table that now holds it, so a value reading its own name reads itself and refuses as a circular definition, while here the value is evaluated where it is written and reads the previous definition
